# Security

- Never commit `.env`, API keys, tokens, or credentials.
- Never paste secret values into chat, issues, or logs — report path/pattern only (see [`Agents/Security/AGENTS.md`](../../Agents/Security/AGENTS.md)).
- Config may name env vars (`api_key_env`) but must not embed values.
- Do not add network calls that exfiltrate repo data unless the user explicitly asks.
- Treat generated protobuf and lockfiles as code — no smuggling secrets into comments.
